    <td colspan="2" style="color:#655665; font-family: helvetica,arial; font-size:80%"><b>
No explicit information on uncertainties of observed or Ritz wavelengths is available in ASD for this selection of lines.<br />
<u><i>&lambda;</i> in</u>: <span style="color:darkred">vacuum</span> <span style="color:navy"></span><br />
<u>Highest relative intensity</u>: 1000<br />
